# Resource Exhaustion & Rate Limiting Auditing Rule

When tasked with evaluating rate limiting, unconstrained form submissions, destructive action re-authentication, or resource exhaustion:
1. Follow the **25-Check Audit Matrix** in `.agents/skills/resource-exhaustion/references/exhaustion_checklist_tracker.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/resource-exhaustion/SKILL.md`.
3. Audit mandatory re-authentication on account deletion, form rate limiting, payload size caps, and queue throttles.
4. Record structured findings in `artifacts/resource_exhaustion_audit_report.json`.
